{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/ltu8e6a4onzhwejwxpf2l4834xrzbur.mp3","text":"博士，我会在旁边写报告或者读书，需要的时候随时可以叫我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/jsaicp5ydjuyjnufqu0fypi02lvk7r0.mp3","text":"努力就会有回报，我一直这么认为，也一直是这么做的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/rogldegpg19rpop8ih8b882clt84wz4.mp3","text":"......咦，矿石病居然还有这种特性吗！这可要立刻做个实验验证一下，博士，我先离开一会儿......嗯，不知道基地里有没有正好合适的观察对象呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/qb92b48qav3yr1p3pd1w9skrochbjps.mp3","text":"没有红茶的一天，可不是完整的一天。博士，你也要来一杯吗？我这里有全维多利亚最好的茶叶。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/qn0q2ixroeht6wk5fv1m9nyagg22acd.mp3","text":"我从小就和黑在一起，有关她的事，我全都知道，包括她来到我身边之前的经历。啊，不过这个可不能轻易告诉你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/akg74bn5bov7cwz59n15sw7xl48a9lm.mp3","text":"如果我能找到治疗黑的办法，不就意味着我也能治好其他感染者吗？放心吧，博士，我没有那么自私。但也请你明白，我不会掩饰，黑在我的心中是最重要的这件事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/ibcckxr6n2ysdp6sm1zw2pwv1i8mitk.mp3","text":"研究源石的道路十分广阔，博士。不过，对我来说，我只想找到能治疗黑的方法，所以，当我听说了罗德岛的一些事情后，我一直对这里心怀憧憬。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/02/pzhjabx4zkdqp08mwi3z63pfgilcdsh.mp3","text":"你知道吗，博士，我最讨厌因为黑的感染者身份而排斥她的人。而在这里没有人会排斥她，我也能学到更多的医学知识......来罗德岛真是一个正确的决定。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/etuvn5p9dexwelblwn11rmvbh2t5sxe.mp3","text":"无论多么优秀的领导者，也有可能因为一念之差而被利益冲昏头脑，你要当心，博士。不过，哼哼，你也不用太担心，有我在，如果有一天你行差踏错，我会纠正你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/i96tda5emk7dg8gyit98pujiwzeo4u2.mp3","text":"博士，坐着睡觉可不是好习惯......好吧，至少给你加条毛毯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/ft84v4b59dthz2xa48fgqod8om21f1z.mp3","text":"你好，我是锡兰，维多利亚国立大学毕业，专攻方向是源石研究，经过凯尔希医生批准，从今天起在罗德岛实习，请多关照，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/31/mwa6u1ffol9qxzm43h4hmj26eh9oh0h.mp3","text":"不愧是罗德岛，在源石技艺的运用方面真是厉害呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/ih8us8vdcfbe66ip5fsr12d5oh0t6m6.mp3","text":"这样我就是正式得到罗德岛承认了吗？谢谢，博士，我会更加努力的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/nd21l8xntfsct6gtammut84h7qhmdwt.mp3","text":"罗德岛对矿石病的研究果然名不虚传，在这里学习下去的话，总有一天我一定能把黑的病治好！博士，也请你助我一臂之力吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/9bulhnspc3hpd2d4yxzrqo2v60pqb71.mp3","text":"任务吗？正好，我可以试验一下新的源石运用技巧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/jdmrh5dgse795rc10o7w8n5ygqj63la.mp3","text":"放心吧，我还挺擅长指挥的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/hqn4fu0hl3ukdzlz1sqrb08xi75v4fp.mp3","text":"沿途不知道会不会有些稀有的材料呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/f3lud5ccqa53dt99cbfodoax76e8yw8.mp3","text":"不要慌张，冷静应对。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/70bo2oehgpt2p14byckyzqfsjdr04cg.mp3","text":"伤员在哪里？","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/po3e43oyrhwt51kxz2t7xkkh5g905nh.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/iw2wa69gcrqckdef6uesdnh2clwftxu.mp3","text":"辅助就交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/86y862hvhewfn97d4mnyro5hyn0smn4.mp3","text":"伤员不要剧烈活动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/24mrezqe45ozvsqabj3iyj5bsnodgrn.mp3","text":"安心战斗吧，各位。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/fb8au1kbu0uq0x0jdhynd6x8dos3bna.mp3","text":"集中精神面对眼前的敌人！","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/ar8wrlzws1svy1vhgmau5uf64skwuk3.mp3","text":"这招应该更符合现在的状况。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_027.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/qnvynn3qih9kwr4dew94dz9v17goo4b.mp3","text":"呼......呵呵，感觉就像是完成了一场困难的实验，虽然很累，不过也很充实。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/29/3r4fftyvj0iaq1pbqb2rmrinjycu6da.mp3","text":"应该没有敌人了吧？那我去周围稍微逛逛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/tu94bee2gr15wgjobn3g3bekhshxv5r.mp3","text":"要是我能像黑一样，肯定不会让他们跑了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/mr4ed3ky6zxgq4zmbc61whlofi1uepq.mp3","text":"博士，别愣着，来帮忙抬伤员！","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/pbjiutx0e5qugsp8dk3gk1nd9jtdomb.mp3","text":"和基地里其他的医生们交流一下好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/cmcmovnyzpqmolti4gc734cb29p5p7b.mp3","text":"等等，我头发都要乱了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/nuj24y5hem4f6azwqn5ind92obqiuad.mp3","text":"博士该不会又在座位上睡着了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/ekqog8xvdxcfvltg5osy16azhiok5nr.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/rbvnvzn9734hqca3ejvxehkbz0yv0y7.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。嗯，我先在这里跟医疗部的同事们闲聊一会儿，晚些再去找黑。在家里过新年当然比不上在罗德岛有趣，而且我给父亲寄过贺卡了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/hbm6rpqms965fiol79ds5vjajyq0r8t.mp3","text":"你好，博士，来和我一起喝杯红茶吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_348_ceylon/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/k6pq1d6pob01u5eulvar5j6ja7w056d.mp3","text":"博士，我会在旁边写报告或者读书，需要的时候随时可以叫我。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/8kptugx3jsk5y667s9fu6xreg5qhqcd.mp3","text":"努力就会有回报，我一直这么认为，也一直是这么做的。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/0344m6iirv7jb8leybhhx3llh83nhdb.mp3","text":"......咦，矿石病居然还有这种特性吗！这可要立刻做个实验验证一下，博士，我先离开一会儿......嗯，不知道基地里有没有正好合适的观察对象呢......","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/oxpng0x9hem95jccn9owytulzz08yjy.mp3","text":"没有红茶的一天，可不是完整的一天。博士，你也要来一杯吗？我这里有全维多利亚最好的茶叶。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/qtnna7to8wjc2rflayyexrfv593bz57.mp3","text":"我从小就和黑在一起，有关她的事，我全都知道，包括她来到我身边之前的经历。啊，不过这个可不能轻易告诉你。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/ggrk2dkygannpi4a4h0vu5dqcmncev1.mp3","text":"如果我能找到治疗黑的办法，不就意味着我也能治好其他感染者吗？放心吧，博士，我没有那么自私。但也请你明白，我不会掩饰，黑在我的心中是最重要的这件事。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/r3v8ybce8hdi25wj6zfhuh5hx8w5ksv.mp3","text":"研究源石的道路十分广阔，博士。不过，对我来说，我只想找到能治疗黑的方法，所以，当我听说了罗德岛的一些事情后，我一直对这里心怀憧憬。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/477v6pwfgna57wh6piyp5v9pyb6ue64.mp3","text":"你知道吗，博士，我最讨厌因为黑的感染者身份而排斥她的人。而在这里没有人会排斥她，我也能学到更多的医学知识......来罗德岛真是一个正确的决定。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/ql35sfaewusi8pt2ey4l2fyxnk5i7jm.mp3","text":"无论多么优秀的领导者，也有可能因为一念之差而被利益冲昏头脑，你要当心，博士。不过，哼哼，你也不用太担心，有我在，如果有一天你行差踏错，我会纠正你的。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/ga075xzn5sygn4g9mso78y5vx7mbig3.mp3","text":"博士，坐着睡觉可不是好习惯......好吧，至少给你加条毛毯。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/tdn30w62079ba4ru1qobuoi1pzncvpc.mp3","text":"你好，我是锡兰，维多利亚国立大学毕业，专攻方向是源石研究，经过凯尔希医生批准，从今天起在罗德岛实习，请多关照，博士。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/qep60hhr7qigmx9l4cp7hrhfapm7hsz.mp3","text":"不愧是罗德岛，在源石技艺的运用方面真是厉害呢。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/j6g68eenv8mbb7qjsoxjk0px0gkqzie.mp3","text":"这样我就是正式得到罗德岛承认了吗？谢谢，博士，我会更加努力的！","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/bjg8fuvrzwc76w68ldhnhg8ib09icn3.mp3","text":"罗德岛对矿石病的研究果然名不虚传，在这里学习下去的话，总有一天我一定能把黑的病治好！博士，也请你助我一臂之力吧！","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/ixvwwhswe8592uzynsprfx3px6hqonv.mp3","text":"任务吗？正好，我可以试验一下新的源石运用技巧。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/8dbazl7i2fllhqz4y6eg6jx2yeajw6o.mp3","text":"放心吧，我还挺擅长指挥的。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/71umd6comh6vkp3do8cxtrzrjdcqn7t.mp3","text":"沿途不知道会不会有些稀有的材料呢？","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/mz9hdm84h9br6moc6r9f2qt6defzzt0.mp3","text":"不要慌张，冷静应对。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/sgddhhxm524c2khoy0qvm0cfho9o6u8.mp3","text":"伤员在哪里？","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/cxw2nne1jdg000eorjhcp083e9g4477.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/by1p20u74k91t7clxqw7z1t4o0750i2.mp3","text":"辅助就交给我吧。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/da/jaehv323ey1gabt8rplz5sj3sq35dsg.mp3","text":"伤员不要剧烈活动。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/5c91hl38wt0e5o9zrq84nlqctuxt0k4.mp3","text":"安心战斗吧，各位。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/eagcb6h7y0uftrl6eeyguoea0qpt06m.mp3","text":"集中精神面对眼前的敌人！","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/ny0v44ffsc3crfn3bu2di8xom7y3qhu.mp3","text":"这招应该更符合现在的状况。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_027.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/titnd26z4oc1t4zq01zt91ldrqecmt7.mp3","text":"呼......呵呵，感觉就像是完成了一场困难的实验，虽然很累，不过也很充实。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/gyu6izi812sqx8ngk80utydjdi3qmnd.mp3","text":"应该没有敌人了吧？那我去周围稍微逛逛。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/ouzht8iaajgc1rjbr5vuiq316713wxo.mp3","text":"要是我能像黑一样，肯定不会让他们跑了......","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/k9l8d285qrxa37ixq7nibtzww23sasr.mp3","text":"博士，别愣着，来帮忙抬伤员！","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/gc3t259w2l2ict2qi8mkpepxbn2p2fp.mp3","text":"和基地里其他的医生们交流一下好了。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/5szyh1sqkhd539wv0ybq4kfcuowwwkc.mp3","text":"等等，我头发都要乱了！","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/hsottuvzpdnrbmtkvso43t0xk5qv8kr.mp3","text":"博士该不会又在座位上睡着了吧？","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/p6nssy4fweffel3w4abhei7uxswodq7.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/svo9iips6oeo3cgz4hwmbi8unhzk740.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。嗯，我先在这里跟医疗部的同事们闲聊一会儿，晚些再去找黑。在家里过新年当然比不上在罗德岛有趣，而且我给父亲寄过贺卡了。","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/fncvb2f2d31jcn1t3fk5kt1rcidd2lt.mp3","text":"你好，博士，来和我一起喝杯红茶吗？","alt":"voice/char_348_ceylon/cn_042.mp3"}]}}